  "wsCategory": "core-japanese",
  "templateType": "custom",
  "lessonName": "もう・まだ",
  "topicExplanation": "もう / まだ — polarity changes the meaning\n\nもう + affirmative past ≈ already\nもう + negative ≈ not anymore / won't anymore (もうやらない)\nもう～ていない ≈ no longer doing it\n\nまだ + affirmative ≈ still (まだ生きてる？)\nまだ～ていない / まだ～てない ≈ not yet\n\n12 questions for もう, 12 for まだ.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "sec-mou-listen",
      "mode": "audio-listening",
      "title": "もう — listen",
      "instructions": "Listen to the clip and write down what you think it's saying in Japanese. (もう)",
      "audioUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fairy%20Tail/media/Fairy_Tail_041_0.19.47.260-0.19.50.263.mp3",
      "imageUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fairy%20Tail/media/Fairy_Tail_041_0.19.48.762.jpg",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "blk-oyqfr3x",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "blank",
              "name": "blk-oyqfr3x",
              "wide": true,
              "answer": "あんなの もう 全然[ぜんぜん]気[き]にしてないよ"
            }
          ],
          "audioUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fairy%20Tail/media/Fairy_Tail_041_0.19.47.260-0.19.50.263.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fairy%20Tail/media/Fairy_Tail_041_0.19.48.762.jpg",
          "englishAnswer": "I... don't hold any grudges at all..."
        },
        {
          "id": "blk-xwc4p07",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "blank",
              "name": "blk-xwc4p07",
              "wide": true,
              "answer": "はいはい　もういいから― しょうもないことしてないで 出[で]てきなさい"
            }
          ],
          "audioUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fairy%20Tail/media/Fairy_Tail_031_0.06.49.441-0.06.52.986.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fairy%20Tail/media/Fairy_Tail_031_0.06.51.214.jpg",
          "englishAnswer": "Yes, yes... Stop this foolishness and come out, you."
        },
        {
          "id": "blk-phf5t8z",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "blank",
              "name": "blk-phf5t8z",
              "wide": true,
              "answer": "あ ～[〜]はいはいはい もう いちいち ツッコまないから！ あいつをやっつけちゃって！"
            }
          ],
          "audioUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fairy%20Tail/media/Fairy_Tail_131_0.04.38.830-0.04.44.294.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fairy%20Tail/media/Fairy_Tail_131_0.04.41.562.jpg",
          "englishAnswer": "Yeah, yeah! I'm not gonna bother gettin' ticked off at you, just get her!"
        },
        {
          "id": "blk-gnfeu96",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "blank",
              "name": "blk-gnfeu96",
              "wide": true,
              "answer": "そういうずるいことばっかりやってたらもう 切[せつ]嗣と 遊[あそ]んであげないんだから"
            }
          ],
          "audioUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fate%20Zero/media/Fate_Zero_02_0.09.15.720-0.09.20.770.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fate%20Zero/media/Fate_Zero_02_0.09.18.245.jpg",
          "englishAnswer": "I won't play with you if you keep cheating!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sec-mada-listen",
      "mode": "audio-listening",
      "title": "まだ — listen",
      "instructions": "Listen to the clip and write down what you think it's saying in Japanese. (まだ)",
      "audioUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fate%20Zero/media/Fate_Zero_19_0.13.29.840-0.13.32.380.mp3",
      "imageUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fate%20Zero/media/Fate_Zero_19_0.13.31.110.jpg",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "blk-aaexe9f",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "blank",
              "name": "blk-aaexe9f",
              "wide": true,
              "answer": "とりあえずまあまだ 生[い]きてる"
            }
          ],
          "audioUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fate%20Zero/media/Fate_Zero_19_0.13.29.840-0.13.32.380.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Fate%20Zero/media/Fate_Zero_19_0.13.31.110.jpg",
          "englishAnswer": "For the moment, I'm alive."
        },
        {
          "id": "blk-28z7gzw",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "blank",
              "name": "blk-28z7gzw",
              "wide": true,
              "answer": "なんや　まだ 生[い]きてて― 今[いま]にも　わいらのこと　からかいに 来[く]るような 気[き]いするわ"
            }
          ],
          "audioUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Cardcaptor%20Sakura/media/A_CardCaptorSakura36_68_0.09.05.440-0.09.11.310.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Cardcaptor%20Sakura/media/A_CardCaptorSakura36_68_0.09.08.375.jpg",
          "englishAnswer": "I feel like he's still alive and he'll come to make fun of us at any moment."
        },
        {
          "id": "blk-1x07q63",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "blank",
              "name": "blk-1x07q63",
              "wide": true,
              "answer": "ああ まだ 来[き]てないのよ"
            }
          ],
          "audioUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Hyouka/media/Hyouka_08_0.04.58.410-0.05.00.610.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Hyouka/media/Hyouka_08_0.04.58.410-0.05.00.610.jpg",
          "englishAnswer": "She's still not here..."
        },
        {
          "id": "blk-wga0hf6",
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "blank",
              "name": "blk-wga0hf6",
              "wide": true,
              "answer": "いや、まだ 帰[かえ]ってきてない"
            }
          ],
          "audioUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Clannad/media/A_ClannadS01_E15_1_0.06.24.030-0.06.25.700.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://us-southeast-1.linodeobjects.com/immersionkit/media/anime/Clannad/media/A_ClannadS01_E15_1_0.06.24.865.jpg",
          "englishAnswer": "No, he's not back yet."
        }
      ]
    },
